    "body": "\nImport & Export works on its own and is available automatically for tenants whose industry is Import & Export.\n\n## Create the shipment\n\n1. Create a shipment and choose **import** or **export**.\n2. Add the **goods lines**: HS code, quantity, weight and volume.\n3. Add **containers**.\n4. Link a **Purchase** or **Sales** order if you want its lines copied in.\n\nYou can also **import goods lines** from Excel or CSV.\n\n## Move it along\n\nUpdate the status as the cargo moves: **booked → in transit → arrived → customs → cleared → delivered → closed**. The milestone history is kept.\n\n## Parties\n\nKeep your **suppliers**, **buyers**, **forwarders**, **clearing agents**, **carriers** and **banks** as parties and attach them to shipments.\n",
