    "body": "\n## Connect your mailbox\n\nCampaigns send from **your own mailbox**: Google, Microsoft or SMTP/IMAP.\n\n## Build the campaign\n\n1. Create a **campaign** with several steps, each a template.\n2. Set the **send window** in your time zone. Warm-up limits keep sending volume sensible.\n3. Choose your prospects.\n\nEvery email carries an **unsubscribe link** and your sender address. **Suppression lists** keep unsubscribed people out, and a campaign **pauses itself** on bounces or complaints.\n\n## Read replies\n\nReplies arrive in the **Inbox**, classified so you can see which ones matter.\n\n## Business profile\n\nIn settings, your business profile is pre-filled from your company settings and industry: what you offer, your ideal customers and preferred business types.\n\n## Good to know\n\nCold email must comply with local law and recipients' consent expectations. Connecting a Gmail account for the public requires Google's app verification.\n",
