    "order": 2,
    "body": "\n## Open a shift\n\n1. On the cashier screen, choose to open a shift and enter the starting cash float.\n2. Start selling. Sales, refunds and cash movements are attached to your shift.\n\n## During the day\n\n- Record **cash in** and **cash out** with a category, for example paying a supplier from the till.\n- A supervisor can approve sessions where your role requires it.\n\n## Close the shift\n\n1. Choose to close the shift.\n2. **Count the cash** and enter it.\n3. Vrodux compares the count with what it expected and shows the difference.\n4. Print the **Z-report**.\n\nRestaurant orders attach to the cashier's open shift too, so their payments land in the same Z-report. See [Retail & Restaurant POS](/docs/pos/retail-and-restaurant).\n",
