    "body": "\n## Turn it on\n\nOffline mode is a **per-workspace switch**. It works in the browser and in the Windows desktop app.\n\n## While offline\n\nTills record **shifts, sales, refunds, voids and cash movements** locally. Offline sales are never rejected for stock; if stock goes negative, it is flagged.\n\n## When you are back online\n\nChoose **Sync to Cloud** at day end. Syncing twice is safe.\n\n## Good to know\n\n- Switching modes requires everything to be synced first.\n- Vouchers, loyalty and customer search are not available offline, and adding a product needs a connection.\n- Voiding a sale made before going offline cannot be done while offline.\n",
